Schunk PG+70 gripper description — provenance and licence
=========================================================

schunk_pg70.xml and meshes/schunk_pg70/pg70.stl are derived from the ROS 2 package
`moveit_resources_prbt_pg70_support` (Debian: ros-jazzy-moveit-resources-prbt-pg70-support,
version 2.12.4-1noble), which ships the Schunk PG+70 as the gripper of PILZ's PRBT manipulator.

  upstream URDF : urdf/pg70/pg70.urdf.xacro   (macro `schunk_pg70`)
  upstream mesh : meshes/pg70/pg70.stl        (copied verbatim, metres, 8046 triangles)
  upstream SRDF : config/pg70.srdf.xacro      (used to cross-check the closed/open stances)
  homepage      : http://moveit.ros.org

